<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Nov 25.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Nov 25.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Bahrain and the United Arab Emirates discuss joint projects.</p>
<p>AKHBAR ALKHALEEJ</p>
<p>- Ministry of Labour to build four schools for 2.5 million dinars.</p>
<p>AL AYAM</p>
<p>- Bahrain's trade with Arab Gulf states reached 16 million dinars in 1995, according to official figures.</p>
</text>
